  "id": "cauliflower-baked-rice",
  "name": "Cauliflower Baked Rice",
  "subtitle": "A savory rice bake with roasted cauliflower, olives, herbs, and feta",
  "description": "Tender cauliflower and basmati rice are baked together, then finished with dried fruit, a bright honey-vinegar dressing, olives, feta, and fresh herbs.",
